Bootstrap Form Inputs — More
<form class="form-horizontal">

    <div class="form-group">

        <label class="control-label col-sm-2">
            Email:
        </label>

        <div class="col-sm-10">
            <p class="form-control-static">
                someone@example.com
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</form>
.form-control-static → oddiy textni form ichida inputga mos ko‘rinishda joylashtiradi.
