27. Bootstrap Form Inputs (More)

.form-control-static → oddiy textni form ichida ko‘rsatadi

.input-group → input + qo‘shimcha element
.input-group-addon → icon yoki text qo‘shadi
.input-group-btn → button qo‘shadi

disabled → inputni ishlatib bo‘lmaydi
fieldset disabled → butun guruhni disabled qiladi
readonly → ko‘rish mumkin, o‘zgartirib bo‘lmaydi

.has-success → muvaffaqiyat
.has-warning → warning
.has-error → error

.has-feedback → feedback icon
.form-control-feedback → iconni input yoniga joylashtiradi

glyphicon-ok → ✓
glyphicon-warning-sign → ⚠
glyphicon-remove → ✕
